### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run Login first and paste the token below.
@host = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Register
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Secret123" }

### Login (seeded demo user)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@expenseflow.dev", "password": "Demo@1234", "remember": true }

### Add expense
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 540, "category": "Food", "description": "Swiggy dinner", "date": "2026-10-05", "paymentMethod": "UPI", "tags": ["dinner"] }

### List expenses: search + filter + sort + paginate
GET {{host}}/expenses?search=swiggy&category=Food&minAmount=100&sort=highest&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add income
POST {{host}}/income
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 60000, "source": "Salary", "description": "October salary", "date": "2026-10-01", "paymentMethod": "Bank Transfer" }

### Create budget
POST {{host}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-10", "category": "Food", "amount": 5000 }

### Budget progress
GET {{host}}/budgets?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recurring payment
POST {{host}}/recurring
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "expense", "amount": 649, "category": "Subscriptions", "description": "Netflix", "frequency": "Monthly", "paymentMethod": "Credit Card", "startDate": "2026-10-15" }

### Dashboard summary
GET {{host}}/analytics/summary?range=last3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CSV import preview (use curl for multipart: see README)
### PDF report
GET {{host}}/files/report-pdf?type=monthly&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
